# tests/prov-p1/sbx/base.env — the base rootfs of scripts/dv-sbx.sh (docs/design/254-h23-harness.md §4.4.1, D-H11):
# a public Batman release payload, pinned by the sha of its SHA256SUMS line (2026-10-28: equal to the GitHub asset
# digest and to the local build). The sandbox uses its busybox / uci / base only; the PR's feed files are laid over it
# and the helper is built from the PR. Bump on every release that uploads a payload.
BASE_VER=1.5.11-rel.1+6a049f2.fw7049fd8
BASE_URL=https://github.com/winson3QQ/Batman/releases/download/v1.5.11/batman-1.5.11-rel.1%2B6a049f2.fw7049fd8-ekh-bcm2711-ab-payload.tar.gz
BASE_SHA256=73300d1b6cc3d4dc1491565d810df751945b782b7dda9fb4d216bc71ec8d7601
# prov-unit-bcm2710 (smoke, 254-p1-impl §5.1): the same cases on the bcm2710 payload's rootfs (dv-sbx.sh --soc bcm2710)
BASE_URL_BCM2710=https://github.com/winson3QQ/Batman/releases/download/v1.5.11/batman-1.5.11-rel.1%2B6a049f2.fw7049fd8-ekh-bcm2710-ab-payload.tar.gz
